<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="research-state"><strong>Current turn:</strong> <?= e(side_name($battle,$battle['current_side'] ?? 'a')) ?>. Each submitted evidence turn must trigger fresh Trust-Worthy research before any score is posted.</div></div></section>
