<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="battle-grid"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Participant A</div><h2><?= !empty($battle['passes']['a']) ? 'Passed' : 'Still presenting evidence' ?></h2></div><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">Participant B</div><h2><?= !empty($battle['passes']['b']) ? 'Passed' : 'Still presenting evidence' ?></h2></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Final review</div><h2>Only after both sides are finished</h2><?php if (empty($battle['final_review'])): ?><div class="panel"><p>The final assessment is locked until both participants pass. Trust-Worthy must then conduct a fresh whole-case investigation, deduplicate repeated source lineages, attack the apparent leader, audit context/language/logic/power incentives, and compare which explanation best fits the complete reliable record.</p></div><?php else: ?><div class="finding"><p><?= e($battle['final_review']['rationale'] ?? '') ?></p><p><strong>Epistemic assessment:</strong> <?= e($battle['final_review']['epistemic_assessment'] ?? '') ?></p><p><strong>Battle winner:</strong> <?= e($battle['final_review']['battle_winner'] ?? '') ?></p></div><?php endif; ?></div></section>
